Alternative simpler fix: 

```python
def main(args: list[str], out: Stream) -> int:
    value: int = -1
    match parse_count(args[0]):
        case Ok(count):
            value = 1 + count
        case Err(_):
            value = -1
    out.print(value)
    return 0
```

